---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { COMPANY_NAME, COMPANY_LOCATION } from '../data/company';
import { FOUNDER_BENEFIT_PRICE, FOUNDER_BENEFIT_ENTITLEMENT } from '../data/commerce';

const TERMS_VERSION = '2026-08-26';
---

<Layout
  title="Founder reservation and preorder terms | ByteLite LLC"
  description="Terms covering ByteLite LLC founder reservations: what is charged, what is collected, what a reservation does and does not guarantee, and how to withdraw."
  keywords="ByteLite founder reservation terms, preorder terms"
  canonical="https://www.thebytelite.com/preorder-terms/"
>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="draft">DRAFT &mdash; awaiting owner review. Not legal advice.</p>
      <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
      <h1>Founder reservation and preorder terms</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Version {TERMS_VERSION}. {COMPANY_NAME}, {COMPANY_LOCATION}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>1. Are you charged today?</h2>
      <p class="body">
        No. No founder reservation on this site takes a payment. There is no live paid checkout for
        any ByteLite LLC product at the time of writing.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt">2. Is a payment method collected?</h2>
      <p class="body">
        For <strong>Cordel Play</strong>: no. Nothing is stored.
      </p>
      <p class="body">
        For subscription products, a reservation may store a payment method with Stripe for future
        use, and the page will say so plainly before you reach checkout. Storing a payment method
        is not authorisation to charge it. It is not a subscription, and no recurring billing is
        created from a reservation.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt">3. The products are not available.</h2>
      <p class="body">
        ByteLite, Cordel Connect and Cordel Play are all unreleased. A reservation does not give you
        access to any of them, does not guarantee a launch date, does not guarantee admission, and
        does not reserve a position in a queue.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt">4. Before any first charge.</h2>
      <p class="body">You will be shown, and must act to confirm:</p>
      <ul class="list">
        <li>the exact amount and currency;</li>
        <li>the billing interval;</li>
        <li>the date of the first charge;</li>
        <li>how automatic renewal works;</li>
        <li>how to cancel, and where;</li>
        <li>the refund position;</li>
        <li>what the product does and does not do at that time.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="body">
        If you do not confirm, nothing is charged. Silence is not consent.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt">5. The founder benefit.</h2>
      <p class="body">It is two separate things:</p>
      <ul class="list">
        <li>{FOUNDER_BENEFIT_PRICE};</li>
        <li>{FOUNDER_BENEFIT_ENTITLEMENT}.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="body">
        They are not combined: they do not add up to 20% off. The discount applies to the price.
        The additional entitlement applies to whatever that product meters. Those are two
        different units, so adding them together would be meaningless.
      </p>
      <p class="body warn">
        <strong>Open item:</strong> the unit of the additional 10% has not been fixed for any
        product. It will be written here, in specific terms, before that product can be activated
        or charged. Until then no reservation relies on a meaning that has not been published.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt">6. Withdrawing.</h2>
      <p class="body">
        Write to me through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a> and ask to be removed. There is
        no form to find, no retention step and no deadline. Because nothing has been charged, there
        is nothing to refund.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt">7. Cordel Play specifically.</h2>
      <p class="body">
        Cordel Play is a physical product for adults aged 18 or over. It is not a subscription.
      </p>
      <p class="body">
        No paid preorder will be accepted for it until ByteLite LLC has a reasonable basis for a
        stated shipment time and an operating process for delay consent and refunds. The FTC Mail,
        Internet, or Telephone Order Merchandise Rule requires shipment within the promised time,
        or within 30 days where no time is stated, and requires your consent to a delay or a refund
        when that cannot be met.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt">8. Payments and data.</h2>
      <p class="body">
        Payments and payment methods are handled by Stripe. ByteLite LLC does not receive or store
        your card number. What ByteLite LLC retains for a reservation is the product, the plan, the
        founder-offer version and the terms version. See the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt">9. Changes.</h2>
      <p class="body">
        If these terms change materially before you are charged, you will be shown the new version
        and asked to accept it. A reservation made under one version is never silently migrated to
        another.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>

<style>
.narrow { max-width: 780px; }
.page-hero { padding: 3.5rem 0 2rem; }
.draft {
  display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  font-size: .6875rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #fbbf24; background: rgba(251,191,36,.08); border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.3);
  border-radius: 9999px; padding: .3rem .875rem;
}
.hero-sub { max-width: 640px; font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; color: #7b829e; line-height: 1.8; }
h2 { margin-bottom: .75rem; font-size: 1.125rem; }
.mt { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
.body { font-size: 1rem; color: #a0a8c0; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 1rem; }
.warn {
  background: rgba(251,191,36,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.28);
  border-radius: .5rem; padding: 1rem; color: #c4c8f0;
}
.list { list-style: none; margin: 1rem 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: .5rem; }
.list li {
  font-size: .9375rem; color: #a0a8c0; line-height: 1.65;
  padding: .625rem .875rem; background: #0d1120;
  border: 1px solid #1a2235; border-left: 3px solid #6366f1; border-radius: .5rem;
}
</style>
